// Travel destinations (v0.979): named world places for quest Travel
// objectives. A Travel step is done while the player stands within `radius`
// metres of `pos` (XZ, homestead-world frame - the same frame
// entities/wild_spawns.ron uses) AND it is the step they are on (2026-10-04,
// systems::quests::destinations_here): walking past a place before the step
// that asks for it does not count, and standing in it when the step comes up
// does.
//
// A place that is not a fixed point names what it resolves to in `at`
// instead of a `pos` (2026-10-04, the opening's last step):
//   OwnFrontDoor(out_m: m)   the doorstep `m` metres out of the player's OWN
//                            front door, along the corridor its plot's door
//                            makes: on the Commons for a family home's plot,
//                            on the street for a First Street plot, whichever
//                            plot the player was given. A guest (no plot, the
//                            home put away) has none, so it never resolves.
//
// Adding a landmark = adding a row here; reference it from any quest file
// as Travel(destination: "<id>").
(
    destinations: [
        // Just outside the player's own front door (the opening, data/quests/
        // getting_started.ron). 1.5 m out with a 1.5 m radius: it spans the
        // 3 m door corridor from the doorway outward, and the spawn just
        // inside the door (data/homes/homestead.ron, 1.5 m in) is 3 m from
        // its centre, so waking up there is not "stepping out".
        (id: "front_door", label: "your front door", at: Some(OwnFrontDoor(out_m: 1.5)), radius: 1.5),
        // The outdoor crop fields just south of the house.
        (id: "outdoor_fields", label: "the outdoor fields", pos: (29.0, 63.0), radius: 10.0),
        // The berry thicket northeast of the fields (wild_spawns berry_bush cluster).
        (id: "wild_thicket", label: "the berry thicket", pos: (52.0, 82.0), radius: 8.0),
        // The flax stand near the wetter ground west of the thicket.
        (id: "flax_hollow", label: "the flax hollow", pos: (18.0, 88.0), radius: 8.0),
        // The ridge northeast where the wolves den (hostile wildlife setting).
        (id: "wolf_ridge", label: "the northeast ridge", pos: (75.0, 100.0), radius: 12.0),
    ],
)
